<title>BRAZIL: Varig posts Jan-Sept 74.88 mln reais loss.</title>
<headline>Varig posts Jan-Sept 74.88 mln reais loss.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian national airline Varig issued the following statement on its January-to-September results.</p>
<p>				1996			  1995</p>
<p>    Shr	     loss  1.16		   loss 0.07</p>
<p>    Net	     loss 74.88 million	 loss 4.43 million</p>
<p>    Gross revenue     716.48 million	    963.02 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>-- Rio de Janeiro Newsroom 5521 507 4151</p>
</text>
